'''Stormwind Harbor''' is a large port and shipyard, consisting of a series of wharfs, dry docks, and fortifications located in the northwestern area of [[Stormwind City]], with the access point set between the [[Park]] and [[Cathedral Square]]. The Kul Tiran vessel ''Old Tide'' is moored in the harbor and the embassy of [[Davenburg]] lies within it, and the northern gate leads to the [[Merchant's Highroad]] and further into [[Northwind]].

Stormwind Harbor itself is one of the major ports for transport to [[Kalimdor]], thereby replacing the [[Menethil Harbor]] ↔ [[Auberdine]] line connecting the [[Eastern Kingdoms]] to Kalimdor; the line to Auberdine now connects directly to Stormwind City, allowing Night Elf players to avoid the "death run" through the Wetlands. The riding gryphon [[Steelwing]] also offers passage to the [[SI:7 Outpost]] on the island of [[Balor]].

