==Notes==
* Along with [[Alah'Thalas]], Stormwind City is the only other capital city containing a harbor within the city boundaries; sea access to [[Darnassus]] is through [[Rut'theran Village]], which is not located within the city itself. Stormwind and Alah'Thalas are also the only capital cities with an open waterfront within its city boundaries.

